title: "Ancestry-Aware Epigenetic Clock Pipeline"
abstract: "A portable, reproducible, and ancestral composition-balanced epigenetic clock pipeline implemented in Nextflow DSL2. Enables training, evaluation, and cross-ancestry benchmarking of DNA methylation aging models."
